{
  "name": "Cooking workspace rows clear and refill while active jobs still settle through the native station",
  "stopOnFailure": true,
  "steps": [
    {
      "_note": "Run in solo Purge and with a real client on a dedicated Purge host. Disposable spawned survivor, empty native campfire at (-272,61,451), player beside it and Baked Potato known. Keep guard ON. For dedicated confirm the host has a separate idle owner when available. Use rbcooking profile with rbdebug on cooking if comparing workspace render counts."
    },
    {
      "action": {
        "command": "cleararea",
        "args": {
          "radius": 40
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "action": {
        "command": "restore",
        "args": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "action": {
        "command": "give",
        "args": {
          "item": "toolCookingPot",
          "count": 1
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "action": {
        "command": "give",
        "args": {
          "item": "resourceWood",
          "count": 30
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "action": {
        "command": "give",
        "args": {
          "item": "foodCropPotato",
          "count": 2
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "activate": {
        "x": -272,
        "y": 61,
        "z": 451,
        "block": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "waitForWindowOpen": {
        "window": "workstation_campfire",
        "timeout": 10
      }
    },
    {
      "expectUi": {
        "window": "workstation_campfire",
        "text": "Baked Potato"
      }
    },
    {
      "console": "rbcooking profile"
    },
    {
      "action": {
        "command": "type",
        "args": {
          "id": "cookingSearch",
          "value": "RBAuditNoRecipe"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "wait": 1
    },
    {
      "expectNoUi": {
        "window": "workstation_campfire",
        "text": "Baked Potato"
      }
    },
    {
      "action": {
        "command": "type",
        "args": {
          "id": "cookingSearch",
          "value": "Baked Potat"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "waitForUi": {
        "window": "workstation_campfire",
        "text": "Baked Potato",
        "timeout": 5
      }
    },
    {
      "screenshot": "audit_cooking_filter_restored"
    },
    {
      "click": {
        "window": "workstation_campfire",
        "item": "toolCookingPot",
        "shift": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "click": {
        "window": "workstation_campfire",
        "item": "resourceWood",
        "shift": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "click": {
        "window": "workstation_campfire",
        "text": "Turn On"
      }
    },
    {
      "click": {
        "window": "workstation_campfire",
        "text": "Baked Potato"
      }
    },
    {
      "markItem": "foodCropPotato"
    },
    {
      "click": {
        "window": "workstation_campfire",
        "id": "pullIngredients"
      }
    },
    {
      "expectItemDelta": {
        "name": "foodCropPotato",
        "op": "==",
        "value": -1
      }
    },
    {
      "markItem": "foodBakedPotato"
    },
    {
      "click": {
        "window": "workstation_campfire",
        "text": "COOK"
      }
    },
    {
      "waitForUi": {
        "window": "workstation_campfire",
        "text": "READY TO TAKE",
        "timeout": 120
      }
    },
    {
      "click": {
        "window": "workstation_campfire",
        "id": "rebirthCookingTake"
      }
    },
    {
      "expectItemDelta": {
        "name": "foodBakedPotato",
        "op": "==",
        "value": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "action": {
        "command": "key",
        "args": {
          "name": "Escape"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "expectStation": {
        "x": -272,
        "y": 61,
        "z": 451,
        "station": "campfire",
        "field": "queueCount",
        "op": "==",
        "value": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "expectLog": {
        "contains": "workspace layout="
      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "Compare cooking jobs before/after; one native ticket must clear after take and no second output or XP may appear. For a cold restart keep a separate real job in progress and compare its token and eventual output/XP across rejoin. Use nearby-storage input and two active plus one idle owners in the dedicated follow-up. Inspect camper cooking and shared milling station screenshots separately. For layout, compare idle and repeated ingredient/fuel changes while profiling. Change window size and panel opacity on the open workspace and verify their new values appear on the existing layout cadence."
    },
    {
      "expectNoErrors": true
    }
  ]
}
